{"content":[{"c":["JESHIMON"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Desolate wilderness at the end of the Dead Sea, not far from Pisgah and Peor (",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.20","r":"Num.21.20","rawR":"Num.21.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.20","value":"Num.21.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 21:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.23.28","r":"Num.23.28","rawR":"Num.23.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.23.28","value":"Num.23.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"23:28"},"). In both passages the ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," renders it “wasteland” in the text but has “Jeshimon” in the margin, allowing it to be translated as a specific area. The ",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," uses “desert.”"],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Wilderness to the north of the hill of Hakilah and of Maon (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.23.19,24","r":"1Sam.23.19,24","rawR":"1Sam.23.19,24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.23.19,24","value":"1Sam.23.19,24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 23:19, 24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.26.1-3","r":"1Sam.26.1-3","rawR":"1Sam.26.1-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.26.1-3","value":"1Sam.26.1-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"26:1-3"},"); this location was probably just a few miles south of Hebron."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jeshimon","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 21:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.20","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.20","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.20"},{"anchorText":"23:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.23.28","rawQueryValue":"Num.23.28","sourceRefExact":"Num.23.28"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 23:19, 24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.23.19,24","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.23.19,24","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.23.19,24"},{"anchorText":"26:1-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.26.1-3","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.26.1-3","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.26.1-3"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e63d4771bdb14bcc9bbaa857edf347fe4fd85faf2f73b1d5ee09eafde1869099","sourceItemName":"Jeshimon","sourceItemOrder":211,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jeshimon","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jeshimon","title":"Jeshimon","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}